# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line ending policy for this repository.
#
# The important entry is "gradlew": it is a shell script, so it must keep LF
# endings even when it is checked out on Windows, otherwise it stops working
# on Linux and macOS. "gradlew.bat" is the opposite case.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

* text=auto eol=lf

gradlew text eol=lf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary files must never be line-ending converted.
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.wav binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
